      "3 s: driver presses the button → error on dashboard, HUD and light bar (R16), activation warning 'Update needed' (R49, IR16).",
      "10 s: Director applies the map update (R11).",
      "12 s: driver presses again → HFDS engages."
    ],
    "watchFor": [
      "The rejection lists the failed check, not a generic error.",
      "Warning and rejection are logged."
    ]
